  "releaseNotes": "Update StorageData MimeTable And Fix leaking memory in HttpModel, Utf8Map:\n      - Add a case-insensitive ReverseMimeTable for MIME->extension lookups and introduce numerous unique file magic number constants plus a MagicTable for file type detection (images, audio, video, archives, executables, DBs).\n      - Preserve AllocHeaderOption when cloning HttpModel and reset AllocHeaderOption plus clear header/cookie caches during reset.\n      - Fix Utf8Map.Clear to initialize _hashBuckets if null, clear it, clear _frozenBuckets and null the reference to avoid stale state.\n      - Change TryGetHeader<T> and TryGetCookie<T> to return ReadOnlySpan<byte> instead of ReadOnlySpan<T>\n      - Removed MemoryMarshal.Cast<byte,T> calls and return the underlying byte data directly from the stored buffers.\n      - This simplifies the implementation and avoids unsafe generic span casts; update callers to handle byte spans for header and cookie values.",
